<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>台股均線買賣訊號系統 · 站內小工具</title>
<meta name="description" content="台股 K 線 + 均線訊號 + 法人買賣超 + 盤中監控 + 自選股">
<style>
  *,*::before,*::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; height: 100%; background: #0d1117; color: #e6edf3; }
  body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "Microsoft JhengHei", sans-serif; }
  .frame-shell { position: fixed; inset: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: #0d1117; }
  .frame-bar { flex: 0 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 10px 16px; background: #161b22; border-bottom: 1px solid #30363d; font-size: 13px; }
  .frame-bar .dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background: #ff5f56; box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(255,95,86,0.6); transition: background-color .2s, box-shadow .2s; }
  .frame-bar .dot.dot-connecting { background: #8b949e; box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(139,148,158,0.4); animation: dot-pulse 1.4s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .frame-bar .dot.dot-online { background: #3fb950; box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(63,185,80,0.55); }
  .frame-bar .dot.dot-offline { background: #ff5f56; box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(255,95,86,0.6); }
  @keyframes dot-pulse { 0%,100% { opacity: .55 } 50% { opacity: 1 } }
  .frame-bar .label { color: #e6edf3; font-weight: 600; }
  .frame-bar .sub { color: #8b949e; transition: color .2s; }
  .frame-bar .sub.health-online { color: #3fb950; }
  .frame-bar .sub.health-offline { color: #ff7b72; }
  .frame-bar .spacer { flex: 1; }
  .frame-bar a { color: #58a6ff; text-decoration: none; }
  .frame-bar a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .frame-host { flex: 1 1 auto; position: relative; min-height: 0; }
  .frame-host iframe { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0; background: #0d1117; }
  .frame-fallback { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 24px; text-align: center; color: #8b949e; }
  .frame-fallback code { color: #e6edf3; }
  .banner-warn { flex: 0 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 8px 16px; background: rgba(255, 145, 0, 0.12); border-bottom: 1px solid #ff9100; color: #ffb84d; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .banner-warn[hidden] { display: none; }
  .banner-warn .banner-icon { flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 14px; }
  .banner-warn .banner-text { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .banner-warn .banner-text b { color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }
  .banner-warn .banner-text code { background: rgba(0,0,0,.4); color: #ffd89a; padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 11px; }
  .banner-warn button { background: transparent; border: 1px solid currentColor; color: inherit; border-radius: 4px; padding: 2px 10px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 11px; flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1; }
  .banner-warn button:hover { background: rgba(255, 145, 0, 0.2); }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .frame-bar { flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .frame-bar .sub { display: none; }
    .banner-warn { font-size: 11px; padding: 6px 10px; gap: 8px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="frame-shell">
    <div class="frame-bar">
      <span class="dot" id="healthDot"></span>
      <span class="label">📊 台股均線買賣訊號系統</span>
      <span class="sub" id="healthLabel">連線中…</span>
      <span class="spacer"></span>
      <a href="/stock-app/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">在新分頁開啟 ↗</a>
    </div>
    <div class="banner-warn" id="backendBanner">
      <span class="banner-icon">📡</span>
      <span class="banner-text">
        <b id="backendBannerTitle">後端服務已下線</b> — <span id="backendBannerMsg">個股 API 已於 2026-07-01 停用，詳見 <a href="https://donttalk.vercel.app/blog" style="color:#ffd89a;text-decoration:underline">技術文章</a>。</span>
      </span>
    </div>
    <div class="frame-host">
      <iframe
        src="/stock-app/index.html"
        title="台股均線買賣訊號系統"
        loading="eager"
        referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
        allow="fullscreen; clipboard-read; clipboard-write"
      ></iframe>
      <noscript class="frame-fallback">
        <div>
          <p>此頁面需要 JavaScript 才能載入 iframe。</p>
          <p>請改用 <a href="/stock-app/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">直接連結</a>。</p>
        </div>
      </noscript>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script>
    // Stock backend permanently offline since 2026-07-01.
    // Health probe removed — always show offline state.
    (function() {
      const dot = document.getElementById('healthDot');
      const label = document.getElementById('healthLabel');
      if (dot) {
        dot.classList.add('dot-offline');
        dot.style.boxShadow = '0 0 6px rgba(255,95,86,0.6)';
      }
      if (label) {
        label.textContent = '後端已下線';
        label.classList.add('health-offline');
      }
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
